<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2298" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰθαλ-όεις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όεσσα</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όεν</span>, 
			contr.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰθᾰλοῦς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦσσα</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦν</span>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴθαλος</span>):—poet. Adj.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>smoky, sooty</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλαθρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.415
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				13.13
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόνις αἰ.</span>
			<i>black</i> ashes <i>that are burnt out</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				18.23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				24.316
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>burning, blazing</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεραυνός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					72
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				183
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλόξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					992
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>burnt-coloured</i>, i.e. <i>dark-brown</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σάϊς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					566
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥώξ</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				716
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
